		margin: 1.5em 0;
		padding: 1em;
		background: #fafafa;
		border-radius: 8px;
		overflow-x: auto;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.mermaid-container noscript {
		display: block;
		color: #666;
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 0.95em;
	}
	.mermaid svg {
		max-width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}
	@media print {
		.mermaid-container,
		.mermaid { background: transparent; padding: 0; }
		.mermaid svg { filter: grayscale(1); }
	}
</style>
